Verse 1:
[C]Dismiss us, [F/C]Lord, [C]with [G]blessing, [G7]we pray;
[G7]As from Thy worship [C]we go our ways;
[C]Guide in life’s conflicts, [Dm/F]all [F]through [G7/F]the [F]day;
[F/A]Save in [G#7]Thy [C/G]kingdom, Thine [G7/D]be the [C]praise.
[F]Amen.
